<p>
  Each verdict below was reached by interrogating the pinned distribution — its
  help output, and where that was ambiguous its own bytecode — never from a
  README or an assumption about the runtime. <strong>No adapter is patched,
  forked, or invoked outside its released interface to make a batch
  possible.</strong> An adapter that ships no way to analyze several cases in
  one process has no warm figure here, and none is estimated for it from its
  runtime or from another adapter's slope.
</p>

